From d93f76d7c5e8f575cd066bacb96e89751828d612 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiasClear <noreply@biasclear.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:41:45 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] Explain eval: record the phrase-bank hash with each raw
 selection (304)

The evaluation's direct invoke returns `bankHash`, the SHA-256 of the
bundled phrase bank, beside the model's raw selection; the displayed
explanation stays in the body only. sampleOf and perAnswer carry it, so a
recorded id can't be re-read against an edited bank (304 found one stale
id, u8, after a renumbering).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
